{{!-- System, result and topic icons (FD-115, FD-116): in-house line drawings on a 48 px grid,
1.5 px strokes at every size (non-scaling), currentColor with the .la parts in --accent, so they
follow the theme. Decorative: the text beside each one names it.
Usage: {{> icons/line-icon name="tank" size=96}} — system and results: tank, dashboard, relay, soil,
pump, monitor, gear, sun; topics: hen, fish, sun-water, tractor, leaf, greenhouse. `size` sets
the box (default 24). --}}
